[I] C-API library for CLP, CBC, and CGL

[T] CoinMP is a C API library that provides a simple, common interface to
[T] the COIN-OR solvers Clp (linear programming), Cbc (mixed integer
[T] programming) and Cgl (cut generators). It allows applications to load,
[T] solve and query optimization problems without using the C++ APIs, and is
[T] used e.g. by LibreOffice.

[U] https://www.coin-or.org/

[A] Bjarni Kristjansson {www.maximalsoftware.com}
